.TH "PYFEEDGEN.TEX" "1" "Dec 14, 2025" "1.0" "python-feedgen"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
pyFeedGen.tex \- pyFeedGen Documentation
.SS Table of Contents
.INDENT 0.0
.IP \(bu 2
Feedgenerator
.INDENT 2.0
.IP \(bu 2
Installation
.IP \(bu 2
Create a Feed
.IP \(bu 2
Generate the Feed
.IP \(bu 2
Add Feed Entries
.IP \(bu 2
Extensions
